# What `gcloud builds submit` uploads from this directory.
#
# This file takes precedence over the .gitignore fallback, so it is the explicit guard that
# keeps the local virtualenv and any local .env out of the upload - the build context is
# uploaded in full before Docker ever sees it. The image needs only the package, ops/ and
# wsgi.py, so the tests, the deploy scripts and the docs do not travel.
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.env
.env.*
deploy/
tests/
README.md
.gitignore
.gcloudignore
.dockerignore
